        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/9fc29f/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-11-16T01:44:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<blockquote><p>The Warden runs a tight operation: besides the entire prison itself being kept separate from any known time-space dimension, the individual cells are cycled through time loops to nullify whatever powers or abilities the prisoners could bring to bear on the guards.</p></blockquote><p>Looks like that will be a card that says \"Heroes cannot use Power.\"</p>",
