        "created_at": "2012-11-16T02:54:45.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"lugaru\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/lugaru/48/2767_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> lugaru:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Yeah, I had honestly forgotten the time cataclysm and was like \"oh man! and we have 1 more enviroment!\"Still this promo one just made the expansion for me, it feels as if they went \"hey lugaru, what enviroment do you want next?.. no a magical kingdom made of chocolate is not exactly action packed… how about a supervillain prison?\"&nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Just to nitpick, SIlver Gulch is the promo; The Block is part of Shattered Timelines.</p>",
